  "description": "[SUPERSEDED — use PostQuantum.AspNetCore instead.] ASP.NET Core authentication handler for PostQuantum.Jwt — adds AddPqJwtBearer() so post-quantum (ML-DSA-65) tokens slot into the standard authentication pipeline. Includes an HTTP-fetched key ring (a JWKS-equivalent) for kid-based rotation across services. Fail-closed by construction. This package has been replaced by PostQuantum.AspNetCore (cleaner naming, dedicated release cadence, event-hook surface, hosted-service warmup, SignalR support). The new package is wire-compatible — tokens minted under either validate in the other. Migration guide: https://github.com/systemslibrarian/postquantum-aspnetcore/blob/main/docs/MIGRATION.md.",
